{
  "bookId": "rewind-39",
  "id": "chapter-157",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "noticeKind": "placeholder",
          "text": "原文中的动态称谓保留为占位符：|101|＝玩家昵称。",
          "type": "notice"
        }
      ],
      "id": "reading-note",
      "title": "阅读说明"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "34711001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "冈田彩音",
          "text": "阳子姐，靠右边，靠右边！\n不对，再往左边去一点。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34711002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "夏澄阳子",
          "text": "很好，我已经感受到了「它」的存在。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34711003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "冈田彩音",
          "text": "就是现在！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34711004",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "夏澄阳子",
          "text": "喝呀——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34711005",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "text": "嘭——！",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34711006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "夏澄阳子",
          "text": "收工。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34711007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "好险好险，汁水差点溅到镜头上。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34711008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "穗香",
          "text": "好厉害……西瓜被手刀完全破坏了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34711009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玛莉萝丝",
          "text": "……玛莉也能做到这样的事吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34711010",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "过了一段时间——",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34711011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "穗香",
          "text": "哈——呼——\n稍微有点累了呢……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34711012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玛莉萝丝",
          "text": "玛莉还能继续坚持哦。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34711013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "已经跑了很久了，先停下休息吧。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34711014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "大家可以停下来了~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34711015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "穗香",
          "text": "啊，岛主快看，前面有一座好大……的向日葵？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34711016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玛莉萝丝",
          "text": "是向日葵形状的沙雕？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34711017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "看上去有点眼熟……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34711018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "穗香",
          "text": "咦，前面的沙子好像在动？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34711019",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "葵",
          "text": "唔……是谁在打扰我睡觉？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34711020",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玛莉萝丝",
          "text": "呜哇，居然从里面钻出来了！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34711021",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "不好意思，我们只是路过。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34711022",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "葵",
          "text": "原来是岛主啊……\n如果没什么事的话，我要继续睡了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34711023",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玛莉萝丝",
          "text": "又钻回去了……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34711024",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "啊哈哈……葵还是老样子，明明是目前积分最高的队伍的成员呢。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34711025",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "居然会是这样。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34711026",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玛莉萝丝",
          "text": "……比「天使与小恶魔」的积分要高。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34711027",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玛莉萝丝",
          "text": "封面女孩要在挑战赛里好好活跃才行，玛莉有点想……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34711028",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "上午好啊，各位。\n我似乎嗅到了什么挑战者的气息？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34711029",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "顺便一提，我就是葵的搭档哦~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
      "id": "detail-817",
