      ],
      "title": "穿越碧涛之影·Ⅰ"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "34712001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "裁判小狐",
          "text": "泉选手跳了起来！准备使用扣杀了吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34712002",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "看好了！喝——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34712003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "穗香",
          "text": "速度并不快，能够接住！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34712004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "穗香",
          "text": "欸，方向怎么突然变了？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34712005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玛莉萝丝",
          "text": "呜……没接到……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34712006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "裁判小狐",
          "text": "出乎意料，排球居然在空中突然改变了下落的轨迹！\n泉选手得分！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34712007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "裁判小狐",
          "text": "比分来到3：1，「蓝色向日葵」队领先。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34712008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "想要破解的话，你们尽管可以试试。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34712009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "葵",
          "text": "……看来没我什么事了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34712010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "好厉害！这就是泉小姐的拿手必杀技「夏季大三角螺旋扣杀」。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34712011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "取名有点随便啊……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34712012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "穗香",
          "text": "唔……要认真观察……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34712013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玛莉萝丝",
          "text": "嗯，还远远没有结束呢。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34853001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "裁判小狐",
          "text": "泉选手让人熟悉的进球！比分来到4:2！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34853002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玛莉萝丝",
          "text": "真是的……排球好像活了一样，为什么轨迹会这么奇怪？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34853003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "穗香",
          "text": "小玛莉……我们要冷静下来。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34853004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "葵",
          "text": "哈……有点困了……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34853005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "岛主，玛莉她们陷入苦战了诶……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34853006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "输赢并不重要。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34853007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "毕竟展现美丽强大的自我才是挑战赛的意义，这一点上我相信她们。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34853008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "嗯！大家都全力以赴就可以了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34853009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "拉斐尔",
          "text": "怎么了，海伦？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34853010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "海伦",
          "text": "是我的错觉吗？\n空气中好像弥漫着让人不安的因素。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34853011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "拉斐尔",
          "text": "海风，停下来了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34853012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "弗吉尼娅",
          "text": "啧，开始了吗？\n但感觉有哪里不太对……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34853013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "开始什么？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34853014",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "与此同时——",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34853015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "贝歌",
          "text": "情绪的共鸣已经累积到了阈值……时间到了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34853016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "贝歌",
          "text": "请响应我的呼唤，从无光的深海中苏醒……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34853017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "贝歌",
          "text": "（古老的语言）降临吧……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
      "id": "detail-818",
