      "title": "穿越碧涛之影·Ⅱ"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "34713001",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "对面的击球被玛莉双手阻挡，高高地飞到了空中。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34713002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "穗香",
          "text": "我上咯！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34713003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "裁判小狐",
          "text": "起跳姿势非常的眼熟，发生了什么？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34713004",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "排球在穗香的扣击下，以不算快的速度飞向对方的场地。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34713005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "……！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34713006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "葵",
          "text": "这个落点……能够接到。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34713007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "葵",
          "text": "唔？！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34713008",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "排球在半空中忽然改变了轨迹，落在了相反的方向。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34713009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "裁判小狐",
          "text": "穗香选手得分……比分3：4！但这是……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34713010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "穗香",
          "text": "诶嘿嘿，我做到了呢~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34713011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玛莉萝丝",
          "text": "穗香真厉害！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34713012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "……有点意思。\n居然看了几次就学会了我的螺旋扣杀吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34713013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "看上去，穗香不止在排球上，在武道上也会很有天赋吧。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34713014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "虽然绝招被模仿了，但泉很镇定呢。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34713015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "「沙滩排球是热情与活力的比拼」……\n抛掉一切华丽的技巧，真正的胜负才刚刚开始。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34713016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "葵，你还挺得住吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34713017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "葵",
          "text": "哈欠……阳光变得越来越微弱了……\n但是我会坚持到最后一刻的。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34713018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "说起来……天空确实变得阴沉起来了呢。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34713019",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "……是快要下雨了吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34713020",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "葵",
          "text": "「阳光闪焰」！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34713021",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "裁判小狐",
          "text": "葵选手得分！比分3:5，「蓝色向日葵」小队抵达赛点！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34713022",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玛莉萝丝",
          "text": "血之蔷薇，盛开吧！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34713023",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "裁判小狐",
          "text": "玛莉选手吊球得分！比分4：5！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34713024",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "穗香",
          "text": "天使SPIKE——！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34713025",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "裁判小狐",
          "text": "穗香选手击球得分！双方队伍比分扳平！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34713026",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "裁判小狐",
          "text": "不知道为什么各位选手的喊话越来越奇怪了——但只剩下最后一球，就能决定比赛的胜负！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34713027",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "有点燃起来了呢，你们确实是非常厉害的对手。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34713028",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "穗香",
          "text": "嗯嗯，你们也是。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34713029",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玛莉萝丝",
          "text": "正因如此，玛莉绝不会输。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34713030",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "那就等着瞧吧。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34713031",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "吼——",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34713032",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "就在玛莉准备发球时，远处传来了一阵响亮低沉的叫声。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34713033",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玛莉萝丝",
          "text": "嗯？这是什么声音？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34713034",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "……声音是从海的方向传过来的。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34713035",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "发生了什么？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34713036",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "裁判小狐",
          "text": "比赛中止，比赛中止！快点离开沙滩！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34713037",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "有人从水里走出来了……刚才的声音是她发出来的吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34713038",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": "水珠从她身上滴落，半人鱼脸上的悲伤更胜以往。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34713039",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "贝歌",
          "text": "……到底是哪里出了问题？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34713040",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "贝歌？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34713041",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "贝歌",
          "text": "……怎么会变成这样？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
      "id": "detail-819",
